## Linting and formatting

```bash
make lint      # {{LINT_TOOL}} + {{TYPECHECK_TOOL}} (CI-blocking)
make format    # {{FORMAT_TOOL}} (auto-fix, non-blocking)
make check-arch  # boundary linter (CI-blocking)
```

These also run via pre-commit hook (lefthook). The post-write hook runs
the boundary linter after every file write during agent sessions.

