## Adding a new feature

1. Check `docs/architecture.md` — which module owns this?
2. Check `docs/quality.md` — is there relevant debt to address first?
3. If the task spans multiple sessions, create a plan: `make plan name=<slug>`
4. Write a failing test
5. Implement in the correct module
6. `make lint && make test && make check-arch`
7. Open PR — CI must pass before merge

---

## Harness maintenance

```bash
make gc        # scan docs/code for drift — run monthly or after big changes
make check-arch  # run after any structural refactor
```
